{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "subtitles-pgs",
  "operation": "pgs-receiver-display",
  "candidate": "playback-worker",
  "worker_operation": "pgs-",
  "reference": "ffmpeg-formats-native",
  "contract": [
    "the 229 recorded PGS cases in crates/subtitles/tests/native-compatibility-gold, each a capsule of up to 64 complete PGS packets with raw PTS, DTS and time base, the forced-only option and hard resets",
    "every packet decoded through compat::pgs::ReceiverDecoder on the candidate and FFmpeg's pgssub decoder through avcodec_decode_subtitle2 on the reference; a hard reset reopens the decoder",
    "each published subtitle folded with its packet, consumed bytes, PTS in microseconds, display window and canvas; each rectangle with its geometry, forced flag, stride, index plane, 256-entry ARGB palette and the ARGB value of every pixel; a decoder refusal ends the fold",
    "the fold is the digest of the byte transcript each case stores as expected.bin; the expected fold is recorded independently from the reference worker and equals the digest of that recorded transcript"
  ],
